{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/6931a9859c93deab8f7dd98f9d7e701c.avif?t=1758707922\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span>Inspired by the difficult controls of <i>QWOP</i>, <i>Upstairs</i> puts you in control of each calf and thigh as you attempt the seemingly simple task of walking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.poster.avif?t=1758707922\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.webm?t=1758707922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/7dfaf9dbe9aa657b9842ed27d8311b2d.mp4?t=1758707922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk solo or as a group of prisoners on a path to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based leg controls that will do something to your confidence </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player &amp; Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutual tripping functionality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Necessary ragdoll physics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments with an ominously vague sense of purpose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No jump button. There's no jump button.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.poster.avif?t=1758707922\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.webm?t=1758707922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/a30b69bfeeeccf1e0f13b3fd06de9bf3.mp4?t=1758707922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer Note:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out <i>Upstairs</i>, any feedback would be greatly appreciated for future updates. Follow and DM me on X @HENRY_MEAD_</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716360?t=1758707922","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/a3480fa1be3e9633d77ad41088bc83c3d349c244/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758707922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/3ccc5fa72b62e67758bfad1ff50620feb43f5a7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758707922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/3ccc5fa72b62e67758bfad1ff50620feb43f5a7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758707922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3998690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716360/extras/6931a9859c93deab8f7dd98f9d7e701c.avif?t=1758707922\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span>Inspired by 